    "survey_order": "one location or route at a time within a sector; review all 48 sectors and all 20 Wild Zones, then boundary roads, canals and plazas",
    "source_policy": "Use publicly accessible map category entries, gameplay images and independent descriptions as research; record source attribution, ID, date and coordinate space. Do not copy a guide's map artwork/database or bypass access restrictions. Owner photographs only when unresolved evidence warrants them.",
