    "release_gate": "Text may be reviewed independently as clearly labelled research; pin publication requires device identity, aligned entry coordinate, floor evidence, source attribution and confidence. Unknown exit remains null. All runtime changes require branch QA and visual review; no permanent moving Hyperspace pin.",
